ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniIntro::
    .string "GIOVANNI: You have seen me seek\n"
    .string "power in ruins, in industry, and\l"
    .string "before MEWTWO itself.\p"
    .string "Every time, you stood in my way.\p"
    .string "Very well.\n"
    .string "No machines. No inventions.\l"
    .string "No stolen advantage.\p"
    .string "Only a TRAINER and his team.\p"
    .string "Face GIOVANNI, LEADER of the\n"
    .string "VIRIDIAN GYM!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_ROCKET}$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniDefeat::
    .string "Ha!\n"
    .string "That was a truly intense fight.\l"
    .string "You have won!\p"
    .string "As proof, here is the EARTHBADGE!\n"
    .string "{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniPostBattle::
    .string "GIOVANNI: I chased absolute power\n"
    .string "because I mistook control for\l"
    .string "strength.\p"
    .string "A creature in a vat.\n"
    .string "A BALL that never fails.\l"
    .string "A command no one could refuse.\p"
    .string "But MEWTWO answered control with\n"
    .string "defiance.\p"
    .string "My own POKéMON answered trust.\p"
    .string "You stood before power without\n"
    .string "trying to own it.\p"
    .string "You trusted your team, and they\n"
    .string "trusted you.\p"
    .string "That is what I had forgotten.\n"
    .string "That is what TEAM ROCKET must\l"
    .string "learn.\p"
    .string "As of today, TEAM ROCKET changes\n"
    .string "course.\p"
    .string "No more shadows.\n"
    .string "No more conquest.\p"
    .string "I will begin again, not as a tyrant,\n"
    .string "but as a TRAINER.\p"
    .string "Farewell, {PLAYER}.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainEarthBadgeTakeThis::
    .string "The EARTHBADGE is evidence of\n"
    .string "your mastery as a TRAINER.\p"
    .string "But obedience is earned through\n"
    .string "the trust recorded in your\l"
    .string "FIELD AIDE work.\p"
    .string "With it, you can challenge the\n"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
    .string "Go. Your path lies ahead.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "Even I don't know the VIRIDIAN\n"
    .string "LEADER's identity.\p"
    .string "But one thing's certain.\n"
    .string "This will be the toughest of all\l"
    .string "the GYM LEADERS.\p"
    .string "Also, I heard that the TRAINERS\n"
    .string "here like GROUND-type POKéMON.$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory::
    .string "Blow me away! GIOVANNI was the\n"
    .string "GYM LEADER of VIRIDIAN?$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: ?\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: GIOVANNI\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"
